Dialogue: 6,0:19:22.30,0:19:24.16,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}あ～{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}行った行った{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
