Dialogue: 6,0:19:33.74,0:19:35.93,JP,,0,0,0,,と… 鳥ですか
Dialogue: 6,0:19:35.93,0:19:38.03,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}鳥？{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}猫じゃなくて？{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
