Dialogue: 6,0:19:55.80,0:19:58.68,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}そのままにしとくと{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}どうなるんですか{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
