Dialogue: 6,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.53,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}じゃあ{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}行ってくるね{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
