Dialogue: 6,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.45,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}いいですか{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}あきのさん{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
Dialogue: 6,0:20:22.45,0:20:23.66,JP,,0,0,0,,はい
