Dialogue: 6,0:20:43.01,0:20:47.14,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}山の中できっと{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}寂しかったんですよね{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
