Dialogue: 6,0:22:08.36,0:22:10.98,JP,,0,0,0,,{\fscx50}　{\fscx}私{\fscx50}　{\fscx0} {\fscx50}　{\fscx}このあと樹海で取材があるので{\fscx50}　{\fscx}
